[49m[38;5;10m+      1[0m:[38;5;10m[49m //! Differential tests: run the C program and the Rust program as subprocesses
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      2[0m:[38;5;10m[49m //! and compare stdout, stderr and exit status byte for byte.
